            "LastName": "Lindauer",
            "Initials": "A",
            "AffiliationInfo": {"Affiliation": "Allison Lindauer is an assistant professor at Oregon Health and Science University, Portland. Kathryn Sexson is a family NP at Denali Family Healthcare and an assistant professor in the School of Nursing, University of Alaska, Anchorage. Theresa A. Harvath is the associate dean for academics in the Betty Irene Moore School of Nursing, University of California, Davis, in Sacramento. The authors would like to acknowledge Susan C. Reinhard and Heather M. Young, leaders of the No Longer Home Alone video project, and the contributions of Carol Levine, who conducted focus groups with family caregivers regarding the challenges of medication management. Contact author: Allison Lindauer, lindauer@ohsu.edu. The authors have disclosed no potential conflicts of interest, financial or otherwise."}
